<h1>ModigPrepareOutput_TWOAFC_SACC
</h1>

<h2><a name="_name"></a>PURPOSE <a href="#_top"><img alt="^" border="0" src="../../../../up.png"></a></h2>
<div class="box"><strong>Prepares timers for digital output, e.g. juice trigger.</strong></div>

<h2><a name="_synopsis"></a>SYNOPSIS <a href="#_top"><img alt="^" border="0" src="../../../../up.png"></a></h2>
<div class="box"><strong>function ModigPrepareOutput_TWOAFC_SACC </strong></div>

<h2><a name="_description"></a>DESCRIPTION <a href="#_top"><img alt="^" border="0" src="../../../../up.png"></a></h2>
<div class="fragment"><pre class="comment"> Prepares timers for digital output, e.g. juice trigger.
 Called by PrepareBitTbl subroutine in ModigChangeTask.m</pre></div>

<!-- crossreference -->
